 "//": "Story Phase 11 in the galley, at night, inside the Great Sharkstorm. Three sailcloth hammocks strung from the beams for Pete (7-9,9), Bob (9-11,10) and Jim (1-3,7) instead of their sliding sacks; snapped to rags in chapter 102; re-hung with Cheap-O-Rama toy sashes in 106 (and they stay). The kerosene lamp tied to the beams (two ropes, then the six-rope Grand Bedside Illumination System, 15,6). The Grand Stenchmaster's sash on its peg by the ladder (13,3) and his org chart by the stove (4,3) for the review. Tokens on the floor (101). The book goes out of the porthole over the long table (9,2) in 103. The Cheap-O-Rama crate on the open floor under the ladder (13,6). The captain's sacks get a bed sash (106). The meeting round the long table (111).",
